<title>UK: L-Bank sets 300 billion lire seven-year bond.</title>
<headline>L-Bank sets 300 billion lire seven-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager IMI Bank Luxembourg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LANDESKREDITBANK</p>
<p> AMT    300 BLN LIRE  COUPON     7.80	MATURITY    12.NOV.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.472   PAY DATE    12.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 5-50    SALE LIMITS US/UK/IT/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 1</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
